WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.250
Intern Scott had two Guy Fawkes masks left
over from Halloween, and decided to test them

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.250
with SCP-914.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.610
The first mask was placed on the setting "Fine,"
and the machine produced a Guy Fawkes mask

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:16.920
that, when worn, caused the wearer to identify
himself as V from the movie V for Vendetta.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.449
The final mask was placed on the setting "Very
Fine."

00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:23.420
The output produced was a mask which, when
worn, made the wearer attempt to kill the

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.630
most senior person in the room.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:30.990
D-5962 attempted to strange Intern Scott until
the mask was removed and destroyed.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.440
At this point, D-5962 repeatedly hit his head
against his cell wall until he collapsed.

